VIEWPOINT: from a car at the driver's eye height, in the MIDDLE lane of a three-lane motorway, looking ahead.
ROAD: three lanes in our direction separated by broken white lines; a central reservation with a steel crash barrier and street lamps on the left; green noise barriers on the right.
VEHICLES (important, exact positions):
1) about 30 metres ahead in OUR middle lane: a BLUE saloon seen from behind;
2) in the RIGHT lane, slightly ahead of the viewer: a RED SUV with its LEFT INDICATOR clearly FLASHING (amber light on), its front wheels already turning towards our lane, starting to move into the middle lane;
3) in the LEFT lane, almost alongside the viewer: a BLACK car;
4) further ahead in the right lane: a lorry.
LIGHT AND WEATHER: clear day, dry road.
MUST NOT APPEAR: signs with text.
